    "code": "count_mismatch",
    "severity": "warning",
    "message": "The bundle holds 521289 where the producer reported 521636 (results.txt: All target PSMs with q-value <= 0.01 (pxreprise:DEF-PSM-1PCT v1)). Both numbers are kept; treat the producer's as canonical until the difference is explained."
